WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:03.077
Save the decision memo with the use considered,

00:00:03.368 --> 00:00:09.207
chosen action, evidence, uncertainty, consequence, safeguards and responsible

00:00:09.386 --> 00:00:15.238
role. Assign monitoring, correction, escalation and stopping authority.

00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:18.619
Write concrete personal commitments in the Responsible Practice

00:00:18.709 --> 00:00:22.526
Statement. Name a reassessment trigger, such as new

00:00:22.572 --> 00:00:25.905
receipt evidence, a failed hold or changed permission.

00:00:26.186 --> 00:00:29.420
Check real approval boundaries and keep confidential details

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:33.776
out of public evidence. Retain TRACE, PAUSE, the

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:35.887
notice and statement in the same project and

00:00:35.932 --> 00:00:39.418
workbook. Defend the choice with evidence and consequence.
